OL,3,GNEWSAFamily overwhelmed by support for
OL,4,Atractor pull in memory of son
OL,5,
OL,6,FA group of rugby mums said they have
OL,7,Fbeen "blown away" by the support they
OL,8,Freceived as they pulled a tractor four
OL,9,Fmiles to raise money in memory of a
OL,10,Fmuch-loved junior player.
OL,12,FThe event was held in honour of
OL,13,F15-year-old Will Pedley, from Barbon,
OL,14,FCumbria, who died last August.
OL,16,FHis mother, Jess, was part of the team
OL,17,Fwho dragged the 1.3 tonne (1300kg)
OL,18,Fvintage tractor from their village to
OL,19,FWill's former club Kirkby Lonsdale
OL,20,FRugby Union Club to raise money for
OL,21,FLancashire based CancerCare.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
